ian Harrison", "username": "brianeharrison"}, "content": "\ud83d\udea8 I call on Gov. Abbott to IMMEDIATELY convene a special session to REIN IN EXECUTIVE EMERGENCY POWERS\u2026 before Gina Hinojosa is sworn in!\n\nRepublicans lost last night, but Democrats were not sworn in.\n\nWe still have total power in Texas, and we must act like it by using the", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 8186}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToYxXLxh", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 57, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8923011, "raw_content": "The oil companies have been aided by Trump and he encourages the industry....yet the industry stabbed him in the back to keep prices high....\nAll for the propaganda of vote democrat to bring down oil prices. \nSo the American oil executives think they stuffed it to Trump by making midterms go the to the left. How stupid are they? \n", "author": "Koikatrose", "created": 1793824558085, "profile_picture": "HZYOJ4zPKY3A", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "bratt", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Oil back stabbers.", "last_comment_created": 1793838206561, "content": "<p>The oil companies have been aided by Trump and he encourages the industry....yet the industry stabbed him in the back to keep prices high....\nAll for the propaganda of vote democrat to bring down oil prices.\nSo the American oil executives think they stuffed it to Trump by making midterms go the to the left. How stupid are they?</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 11, "score_up": 57, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToYvIleD", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 256, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8921869, "raw_content": "Or as I call us... \"the people who recognize patterns\". \n\nThe border was temporarily secured, and that is great. Other than that, basically nothing was accomplished that helps Americans in our day to day lives. We still have 50+ million illegals here, we still have a legal immigration program that may even be worse. Not a single person was punished for a coup, multiple stolen elections, the Plandemic, the weaponization of govt, the engineered invasion, etc. We are directly in a war for a foreign country and funding another war where neither benefits us. Nothing has been more demoralizing to America First Republicans and Independents. \n\nYes, it will definitely be worse under Democrat Communist control, and yes I still voted. The \"Doomers\" didn't cause this. The cheerleaders caused this, because you will still send your money to neocons who ran out the clock starting in the first quarter. The Neocons who wanted America First stopped just as badly as the Democrat Communists caused this. Now, the cheerleaders will reward them by sending them more money to \"stop the Democrats\".", "author": "BurtMcGirt", "created": 1793794911329, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Idontevenknow", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "The Doomers were right again ", "last_comment_created": 1793833895386, "content": "<p>Or as I call us... &quot;the people who recognize patterns&quot;.</p>\n<p>The border was temporarily secured, and that is great. Other than that, basically nothing was accomplished that helps Americans in our day to day lives. We still have 50+ million illegals here, we still have a legal immigration program that may even be worse. Not a single person was punished for a coup, multiple stolen elections, the Plandemic, the weaponization of govt, the engineered invasion, etc. We are directly in a war for a foreign country and funding another war where neither benefits us. Nothing has been more demoralizing to America First Republicans and Independents.</p>\n<p>Yes, it will definitely be worse under Democrat Communist control, and yes I still voted. The &quot;Doomers&quot; didn't cause this. The cheerleaders caused this, because you will still send your money to neocons who ran out the clock starting in the first quarter. The Neocons who wanted America First stopped just as badly as the Democrat Communists caused this. Now, the cheerleaders will reward them by sending them more money to &quot;stop the Democrats&quot;.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 64, "score_up": 256, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToYxXdLQ", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 44, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8923164, "raw_content": "", "author": "Lol_Garrus", "created": 1793829309751, "profile_picture": "BuEkSYtjGoA2", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Powdered_Sugar", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "doma